From 9a9b6431b6c25ff61687d287c6ed1629937a43d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dis86 patch maintainer <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 13 Aug 2026 15:25:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] simx86: add executable-scoped validator control

---
 src/base/emu-i386/simx86/Makefile         |   2 +-
 src/base/emu-i386/simx86/diis-validator.c | 652 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/base/emu-i386/simx86/diis-validator.h |  20 +
 src/base/emu-i386/simx86/interp.c         |  17 +
 4 files changed, 690 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
